      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is not really a Q&A forum, but just to answer your question.\n\nVRChat's system will automatically update the account and give them access to the \"18+\" tag when they become 18 or older. This can however take up to 24 hours to take effect, because of timezone differences between the user and VRChat's servers.\n\nIf you are still having issues, after a full 24 hours, VRChat might have your date of birth wrong in their system. To fix that you will need to contact VRChat's support team, and they will help you. You make a support ticket here: https://vrch.at/support",
